{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "onr-wsoficio-login-2026",
    "name": "ONR WSOficio — Login",
    "description": "Coleção para autenticação no webservice ONR (`LoginUsuarioCertificado`).\n\n## Pré-requisitos\n\n1. Credenciais no `.env` do projeto (`CERT_PATH`, `CPF`, `EMAIL`, `ONR_SERVENTIA_ID`, etc.).\n2. Campos do certificado PFX — o Postman **não** lê `.pfx` nativamente. Gere com:\n   ```bash\n   node scripts/extract_cert/extract_cert.js\n   ```\n   Isso cria `cert-fields.json` (gitignored).\n3. Importe o ambiente `ONR-Homologacao.postman_environment.json` (gere com `node scripts/postman/export-postman-env.js` ou preencha manualmente).\n\n## Fluxo\n\n1. Preencha as variáveis de ambiente (certificado + CPF/e-mail).\n2. Execute **LoginUsuarioCertificado**.\n3. O script de testes grava `onr_tokens`, `onr_token` e `onr_hash` (SHA-1 de `ONR_SERVENTIA_CHAVE + token`).\n\nDocumentação: `webservice/metodos/LoginUsuarioCertificado.md`, `webservice/hash.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "login_endpoint",
      "value": "https://hml3-wsoficio.onr.org.br/login.asmx",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "soap_action",
      "value": "http://tempuri.org/WSOficio/LoginUsuarioCertificado",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "3.1 Login",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "LoginUsuarioCertificado",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const required = [",
                  "  'SUBJECTCN', 'ISSUERO', 'PUBLICKEY', 'SERIALNUMBER', 'VALIDUNTIL',",
                  "  'CPF', 'EMAIL', 'IDParceiroWS'",
                  "];",
                  "const missing = required.filter((k) => !pm.environment.get(k));",
                  "if (missing.length) {",
                  "  throw new Error(",
                  "    'Variáveis de ambiente ausentes: ' + missing.join(', ') +",
                  "    '. Rode: node scripts/extract_cert/extract_cert.js && node scripts/postman/export-postman-env.js'",
                  "  );",
                  "}",
                  "const endpoint = pm.environment.get('ONR_LOGIN_ENDPOINT') || pm.collectionVariables.get('login_endpoint');",
                  "pm.variables.set('login_endpoint', endpoint);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.text();",
                  "const retornoMatch = body.match(/<(?:\\w+:)?RETORNO>(true|false)<\\/(?:\\w+:)?RETORNO>/i);",
                  "const retorno = retornoMatch && retornoMatch[1].toLowerCase() === 'true';",
                  "",
                  "if (!retorno) {",
                  "  const cod = body.match(/<(?:\\w+:)?CODIGOERRO>(\\d+)<\\/(?:\\w+:)?CODIGOERRO>/);",
                  "  const desc = body.match(/<(?:\\w+:)?ERRODESCRICAO>([^<]*)<\\/(?:\\w+:)?ERRODESCRICAO>/);",
                  "  pm.test('RETORNO=true', () => {",
                  "    throw new Error(`Login falhou: [${cod?.[1] ?? '?'}] ${desc?.[1] ?? ''}`);",
                  "  });",
                  "} else {",
                  "  const idUser = body.match(/<(?:\\w+:)?IDUsuario>(\\d+)<\\/(?:\\w+:)?IDUsuario>/);",
                  "  const idInst = body.match(/<(?:\\w+:)?IDInstituicao>(\\d+)<\\/(?:\\w+:)?IDInstituicao>/);",
                  "  if (idUser) pm.environment.set('onr_id_usuario', idUser[1]);",
                  "  if (idInst) pm.environment.set('onr_id_instituicao', idInst[1]);",
                  "",
                  "  const tokensBlock = body.match(/<(?:\\w+:)?Tokens>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/(?:\\w+:)?Tokens>/i);",
                  "  const tokens = [];",
                  "  if (tokensBlock) {",
                  "    const re = /<(?:\\w+:)?string[^>]*>([^<]+)<\\/(?:\\w+:)?string>/gi;",
                  "    let m;",
                  "    while ((m = re.exec(tokensBlock[1])) !== null) {",
                  "      if (m[1]) tokens.push(m[1]);",
                  "    }",
                  "  }",
                  "",
                  "  pm.test('Tokens retornados', () => pm.expect(tokens.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "  pm.environment.set('onr_tokens', JSON.stringify(tokens));",
                  "",
                  "  const tokenIndex = parseInt(pm.environment.get('ONR_HASH_TOKEN_INDEX') || '0', 10);",
                  "  const token = tokens[tokenIndex] ?? tokens[0];",
                  "  pm.environment.set('onr_token', token);",
                  "  console.log('Tokens:', tokens.join(', '));",
                  "  console.log('Token selecionado (índice ' + tokenIndex + '):', token);",
                  "",
                  "  const chave = pm.environment.get('ONR_SERVENTIA_CHAVE');",
                  "  if (chave) {",
                  "    const hash = CryptoJS.SHA1(chave + token).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex).toUpperCase();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('onr_hash', hash);",
                  "    console.log('onr_hash (SHA-1 chave+token):', hash);",
                  "  } else {",
                  "    console.warn('Defina ONR_SERVENTIA_CHAVE no ambiente para calcular onr_hash.');",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "text/xml; charset=utf-8"
              },
              {
                "key": "SOAPAction",
                "value": "{{soap_action}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\" xmlns:tns=\"http://tempuri.org/WSOficio\">\n  <soap:Body>\n    <tns:LoginUsuarioCertificado>\n      <tns:oRequest>\n        <tns:SUBJECTCN>{{SUBJECTCN}}</tns:SUBJECTCN>\n        <tns:ISSUERO>{{ISSUERO}}</tns:ISSUERO>\n        <tns:PUBLICKEY>{{PUBLICKEY}}</tns:PUBLICKEY>\n        <tns:SERIALNUMBER>{{SERIALNUMBER}}</tns:SERIALNUMBER>\n        <tns:VALIDUNTIL>{{VALIDUNTIL}}</tns:VALIDUNTIL>\n        <tns:CPF>{{CPF}}</tns:CPF>\n        <tns:EMAIL>{{EMAIL}}</tns:EMAIL>\n        <tns:IDParceiroWS>{{IDParceiroWS}}</tns:IDParceiroWS>\n      </tns:oRequest>\n    </tns:LoginUsuarioCertificado>\n  </soap:Body>\n</soap:Envelope>",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "xml"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{login_endpoint}}",
            "description": "Autentica com certificado digital (campos extraídos do PFX) e retorna tokens de 6 caracteres para cálculo do `Hash` nas demais operações.\n\n**SOAP 1.1** — binding `LoginSoap` do `wsdl/login.wsdl`.\n\nOrdem dos campos em `oRequest` (WSDL): SUBJECTCN, ISSUERO, PUBLICKEY, SERIALNUMBER, VALIDUNTIL, CPF, EMAIL, IDParceiroWS."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Módulo 3.1 — Login (`login.asmx`)"
    }
  ]
}
